Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,You know that feeling when\Nyour goals are scattered
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.04,0:00:06.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,across notes, calendars, and\Nhalf-finished lists?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.74,0:00:10.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,This brings everything together\Nin one calm workspace.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.33,0:00:14.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Plan your day. Break big goals\Ninto clear next steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:20.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,Check off progress, and keep notes,\Njournal entries, and your diary close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:22.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,Search across everything instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:25.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,And when you want a\Nbigger-picture view,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.61,0:00:28.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Mind section uses\Nyour real activity
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.75,0:00:32.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to help you spot patterns\Nand move forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:35.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Less mental clutter.\NMore steady progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.04,0:00:37.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your goals, finally\Nworking with you.
